        <p className="mx-auto mt-6 max-w-2xl text-lg leading-relaxed text-zinc-400 sm:text-xl">Ultra-lightweight Rust native terminal host daemon with seamless split-pane tiling, embedded web companion, and authenticated mobile web remote control.</p>
